# Ancient Flames Beckon, Spire of Mea (battlefield.ancient_flames_beckon_spire_of_mea, a Battlefield: index 0, 30
# minutes, six players, entry NPC _0l0). A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with Below the Arks current (a GM): the menu
# 32000 (index 0); the updates: option 0 ignored; 17 (index 1, not in the menu): REQS_NOT_MET; 1 (area 1): entered;
# finished. The Delver of area 1 spawns at the first tick; killed: allDeath sets WON; the win: newPromy 1,
# battlefieldWin 832, 32001 (the area, the clear time, the party size, the time inside, the zone, the index, repeatClear
# 0, one light: arg8 1); finished: the mission's handler (the light of Mea, 1-2 complete, the teleport out). The grant:
# no XP in the trace's lines of its own (grantXP 1500 with grantXPLockout). Out after the cleanup. Below the Arks again
# with the light gone (GMs): entered again; the time prompts on the golden clock: TIME_LEFT 600, 300, 60, 30, 10; time
# up: TIME_IN_THE_BATTLEFIELD_IS_UP, LOST, the forced cleanup: 32002; finished: leaveBattlefield(1).
lists SpireOfMea/_0l0/onTrigger SpireOfMea/onEventUpdate/32000 SpireOfMea/onEventFinish/32000 SpireOfMea/onEventFinish/32001 SpireOfMea/onEventFinish/32002
char zone=SpireOfMea pos=0,-3.8,240 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop BelowTheArks current        # a GM
login
trigger _0l0                            # the menu 32000 (index 0)
update 32000 option=0                   # 0: ignored
update 32000 option=17                  # index 1, not in the menu: REQS_NOT_MET
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: entered
finish                                  # in the arena
tick 2000                               # area 1's Delver spawns
kill DELVER                       # allDeath: WON; the win: newPromy 1, 32001
finish                                  # the light of Mea, 1-2 complete
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield
delkeyitem LightOfMea                   # a GM
warp 179,35,255 TahrongiCanyon
warp 0,-3.8,240 SpireOfMea
trigger _0l0                            # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # entered again
finish                                  # in the arena
tick 1201000                            # 599 s left: TIME_LEFT 600
tick 300000                             # 299 s left: 300
tick 240000                             # 59 s left: 60
tick 30000                              # 29 s left: 30
tick 20000                              # 9 s left: 10
tick 10000                              # time up: LOST, the forced cleanup: 32002
finish                                  # leaveBattlefield(1)
tick 10000                              # the clearance gone
